```css
@layer reset, base, components;   /* declared order: reset < base < components */

@layer base {
  #nav a.link { color: gray; }      /* very specific */
}
@layer components {
  .link { color: navy; }            /* weak, but later layer */
}
```

| Step | Question | Winner |
|---|---|---|
| 1. origin & importance. | author vs user vs browser; !important? | normal: author > user > browser. |
| 2. layers. | which @layer? | later layer (unlayered beats all layers). |
| 3. specificity. | how specific is the selector? | higher. |
| 4. order. | which came last? | later. |

Result: `.link` is **navy**.

